# RevenueCat CLI — Public V2 API

This repository is for the **RevenueCat Public V2 API** at `https://api.revenuecat.com/v2`.

## Authentication
- **Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer <API key>` — API key from `rc config`
- **CLI:** `rc config`, `rc api …`

## Commands
- `rc config` — configure API key and project ID
- `rc subscribers list|get <customer_id>`
- `rc products list`
- `rc offerings list`
- `rc apps list`
- `rc entitlements list`
- `rc charts revenue|overview`
- `rc utilities countries`

## Notes
- For internal dashboard commands (session-based auth), use the separate **`rc-internal`** CLI
- Do not mix Bearer token auth with session cookie auth